        {
          "kind": "Text",
          "text": "<p>Parenting has been consistently challenging, but in the ever-changing digital landscape, it is easy to be overwhelmed and not know where to begin. This seminar will discuss the challenges the next generation is facing and provide tools to help equip you to fight for your kids.</p><p><strong>December 4 | 9 &amp; 10:45 AM</strong></p><p><strong>January 11 | 6:30 PM (during</strong><a href=\"https://www.cccomaha.org/kids\"><strong>Deeper</strong></a><strong>)</strong></p><p><strong>January 8 | 6:30 PM (during</strong><a href=\"https://www.cccomaha.org/middle-school\"><strong>Youth</strong></a><strong>)</strong></p>",
